# Production overviews (#28: #100, #101, #102). Readings come from POST /api/telemetry (see telemetry.http).
# Port matches launchSettings.json (http profile). Paste a bearer token from POST /api/auth/login.
# from/to: ISO 8601 with Z (or an offset, + encoded as %2B) or a date = local midnight in timeZone (default Europe/Bratislava).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token
@installationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Hourly production for one day (default granularity hour)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/production?from=2026-06-21&to=2026-06-22
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5-minute detail for one hour (UTC bounds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/production?from=2026-06-21T10:00:00Z&to=2026-06-21T11:00:00Z&granularity=fiveMinutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Daily production for a month, days by the local calendar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/production?from=2026-06-01&to=2026-07-01&granularity=day
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Monthly production for a year, months in UTC
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/production?from=2026-01-01&to=2027-01-01&granularity=month&timeZone=UTC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actual vs. predicted (predicted values are null until predictions are stored, #111)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/production/comparison?from=2026-06-21&to=2026-06-28&granularity=day
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CSV export, semicolon and decimal comma (Slovak Excel)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/production/export?from=2026-06-01&to=2026-07-01&granularity=hour
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CSV export, comma and decimal point, a year of 5-minute rows (streamed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/production/export?from=2025-07-01&to=2026-07-01&granularity=fiveMinutes&separator=comma
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid: period too long for 5-minute buckets -> 400 with key "to"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/production?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-03-01&granularity=fiveMinutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
